    <string name="rilis_label">Version 0.1 · November 2026</string>
    <string name="rilis_judul">First release</string>
    <string name="rilis_isi">• Limit apps with schedules and screen time quotas\n• Apps lock when the quota runs out, free outside the schedule\n• The quota refills every time the schedule starts\n• Daily, weekly, and monthly statistics\n• Remaining quota reminders and usage summaries</string>
    <string name="faq_label">Common questions</string>
    <string name="faq_tanya_1">Does Noto send my data to the internet?</string>
    <string name="faq_jawab_1">No. Rules, settings, and app usage records are only stored on this device. Noto has no accounts, ads, or trackers.</string>
    <string name="faq_tanya_2">Why does Noto need special permissions?</string>
    <string name="faq_jawab_2">Usage access to count how long apps are used, Accessibility to recognize the app being opened, and Notifications for reminders.</string>
    <string name="faq_tanya_3">Why can apps be opened outside the schedule?</string>
    <string name="faq_jawab_3">Limits only apply during a rule\'s limited hours. Outside those hours apps are free to use, and the quota refills when the schedule starts again.</string>
    <string name="faq_tanya_4">How do I delete all data?</string>
    <string name="faq_jawab_4">Uninstall Noto, or clear its data in Android Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Noto. All rules and usage records are deleted too.</string>
